window.products.push({"id":277027,"name":"36 Pcs Photo Booth Props，Inflatable Selfie Frame and Gold foil Tassel Curtains-Suitable for Birthdays,Graduation, Carnival Party,Anniversary, Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z91WBcNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A must-have for photos: Are you looking for ways to make photos interesting? Using golden photo booth props, you can shoot interesting and happy moments of memories during the party, making your special day so beautiful. Value package: The package contains 30 picture props such as beards, champagne glasses, hats, bow ties, glasses, crowns, etc.，2 customizable theme dry erase paper, 2 gold tassel curtains background and 1 giant sized inflatable selfie frame.Party booth props can create a variety of combinations, as interesting party decorations, will surely be welcomed by friends and family. High Quality experience: Photo frames, Props are all high-resolution digital printing,with durable and bright colors，Waterproof and stain resistant. Customizable mini chalkboards and pink dry erase pen, which can be used to modify the party theme on the card.The frame is made of 2.56*2.13 inch thick non-toxic PVC vinyl to prevent tearing!Gold tassel curtains background is a really shiny prop Create endless possibilities:Transform the celebrations into something special and get better spontaneous pictures with photoshoot props，also as decorations around any special event you may have like a Birthday,Graduation,Cocktail party,Bachelorette party,Engagement, Wedding,Anniversary, Halloween,Christmas,New Year Eve Party masquerade party decorations，as long as there are photo activities, there will be our party photo props Easy DIY: The photo booth party props Just combine props + adhesives + sticks. The inflatable rack is flat for transportation and needs to be inflated. All props materials are safe and environmentally, are packed in a beautiful box, which is suitable for gifting to friends or for personal use. Fun party supplies for kids and adults, Perfectly complement your party games and gatherings. Come and create precious memories with our funny selfie props!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z91WBcNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOCATAL","source_asin":"B09NMZYHX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NMZYHX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NMZYHX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
