window.products.push({"id":277064,"name":"Tahoe Trails Slim Can Cooler Insulated for 12oz Slim Cans | Skinny Can Cooler Insulated Stainless Steel Drink Holder for Hard Seltzer, Beer, Soda, and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HQ7V3Uo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VACUUM SEAL DESIGN | Tahoe Trail's custom designed can cooler is designed to combat heated external environments by vacuum sealing off other sources of air. As a result, this insulated cooler is able to keep the inside surface of the cooler at near frigid temperatures. The air gap vacuum layer acts as a barrier, maintaining a seal from the outside world, while securely holding and protecting the can or bottle within. MULTI LAYER COOLER INSULATION | We have built our can cooler from a multi-level approach. A wall of stainless steal outlines both the inside and outside of the cooler, protecting the metal insulating copper liner that is melded between these plates. This copper plate works to combat the transfer of heat to the vacuumed capsule inside, and is protected from rust by the stainless steel exterior. SWEAT FREE AND DISHWASHER SAFE | Tahoe's trails can cooler multi-metal vacuum design makes it a sweat free can cooler, allowing no condensation to gather on the exterior. Moreoverly, its stainless steel exterior makes it dishwasher safe. This makes it ideal for use at the beach, camping, pool parties, backyard events, and outdoor parties! EASY TO USE AND NON TIPPING CAN COOLER | This stainless steel cooler can be used in a few easy steps. Just twist off the threaded gasket, insert the can or bottle, and replace the gasket with a firm spin. Compare the slick feel and power of the vacuum sealed design to expensive hydroflask cooler cups or Yeti coolers and experience the difference! Let your drinks chill in style and safety, as our can cooler has a balanced metal base that helps to prevent tip overs. NEARLY 10 YEARS OF OUTDOOR LOVE | Tahoe Trails has been providing outdoor products, sports cups, camping tools, and apparel to outdoor lovers since 2013. Our goal is to have our can coolers and products accompany you no matter the outdoor location, keeping your drinks all the chiller for it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HQ7V3Uo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAHOE TRAILS","source_asin":"B0BRSB7RT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSB7RT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSB7RT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
