window.products.push({"id":277088,"name":"HAVLULAND Premium Bath Towel Set| Bathroom Towels Set| Luxury Hotel & Spa Towel Turkish Cotton Super Soft and Absorbent Towels| 27\" x 54'' Extra Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81adKI32wfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 -PIECE 100% PREMIUM TURKISH COTTON TOWEL SET (27\" x 54'') These high-quality hotel and spa collection Turkish towels are made from 100% premium Turkish cotton which allows them to be extremely absorbent, soft and fluffy. Experience a true luxury super soft feel every time you use them. The surface is smooth and not easy to shed, adding to their durability. Edges are reinforced with double needle embroidered stitching to prevent fraying from long-term use and laundering. Perfect for spa, poolside, bathroom, Beach, salon, college dorm room essentials. Each towel is spun from 100% combed cotton - soft, durable, quick-dry, and wonderfully absorbent. It is more absorbent than any Turkish Cotton. Absorbent Turkish cotton is a premium cotton that has extra-long fibers, which makes Turkish towels delightfully absorbent! Turkish Cotton, being one of the most uniquely produced cotton fibers worldwide provides our daily lives with a soft touch that you would not be able to feel anywhere or with any other cotton substitute. 100% Turkish Cotton brings superior quality when it comes to Softness & Absorbency. Premium Quality Towels are 600 to 900 GSM, which make them thicker compared to normal towels, also provides more durability & comfort. These towels are made using 100% Turkish cotton which are super soft & Plush. The softness of these towels will ensure comfort in your daily lives. Perfect combination of softness and strength, the towel set is ideal for everyday usage. Use the towels efficiently in a bathroom, at gym, beach, poolside, salon, spa or even camping trip. CARE INSTRUCTIONS : Machine washable towels. We recommend washing in cold water or Warm Water before your first use. This will cause the cotton fibers to open up and give the towels better absorbency. Tumble dry on low heat or hang them to dry. Please don’t use fabric softener, dry sheets .Chemicals will only reduce the softness of the material. SET INCLUDES: 4 Bath Towels: 27 x 54 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81adKI32wfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAVLULAND","source_asin":"B0BLHQJVM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHQJVM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHQJVM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
