window.products.push({"id":277157,"name":"THREAD SPREAD 1000 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Printed Sheets,Pinstripe Light Grey King Printed Sheets Set, Long Staple Cotton, Sateen Weave for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BJBgnOppL._AC_SL1483_.jpg","description":"Top Quality Egyptian Cotton Sheets King: Our king sheets deep pocket are as soft and comfortable as it gets and will have you sleeping like a baby. These deep pocket sheets king are Standard 100 by OEKO-TEX, leaving no worries of thread count & performance. 1000 Thread Count, Deep Pocket Sheets (4 Piece Set): These luxurious, 1000 thread count sheets king come with a flat sheet (108” x 102”), a deep fitted sheets king size (78” x 80” + 16”) with an all-around elastic that fits an 16” deep mattress, & a pair of 21 x 41” pillowcases. Silky Soft Sheets! These Egyptian cotton sheets set are made from pure Egyptian cotton which is renowned for its softness and durability. These are sateen weave sheets that offer a lavish look to the room a great night’s sleep to you! Our king sheet set, will make you feel like you are on cloud 9, literally! Anti-Pilling & Fade Resistant: Our sateen sheets king size sets use top quality anti-pilling and fade resistant yarns. We believe you deserve the best. Why risk it with other sheets king size that itch and fade in the wash? Here at Thread Spread, we are devoted to serving you with the best sheets possible! In the unlikely scenario of rising quality issues, you can directly write to us so we can address your problems best and on top priority. We also offer our customers a 30 day return and refund policy if they find they are unhappy with the product. Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton king size sheets in warm and tumble dry on low, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures. For bed linens it is important to remove from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BJBgnOppL._AC_SL1483_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B09SFX7WPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SFX7WPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SFX7WPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
