window.products.push({"id":277263,"name":"TASVAC Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 28Kpa Stick Vacuum with LED Display, Up to 50min Runtime, 6-in-1 Lightweight Powerful Vacuum with Detachable Battery S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":128.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6152NmV8VQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【28KPa Cordless Vacuum Cleaner】Electric broom vacuum cordless with 260W electric floor brushes, this cordless stick vacuum cleaner provides up to 28KPa ultra-quiet Hurricane suction(≤ 70dB), picks up debris, cat litter, crumbs, and pet hairs from a variety of surfaces including hardwood floors, low and mid pile carpet, stair and ceiling, sofa and bed, desk and curtain, etc. Peacefully cleaning with less disturbance to your families and pets. 【Hardwood Floor-friendly Vacuum & LED Display】This hardwood floor carpet vacuum with a soft brush that can protect your wood floors. Unlike the beater brush on traditional carpet vacuums, it will not scratch and damage the finish on hardwood floors and stairs. Polished clear LED display combines power display, brush lock rotor display, low battery reminder, duct blockage reminders in one. You can learn about your stick vacuum cleaner cordless in real-time, in case you need it. 【Deep Clean Vacuum Cleaner for Pet Hair】No Secondary Pollution vacuum cleaner cordless with 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system and has whole machine filtration function. which captures 99.99% of particles as small as 0.1 microns. and expels purified clean air. It is safe and friendly to families with babies, elders, and special-care members. if you have pets or allergies, it may be worth it to invest in an S8 for its ability to capture and retain both pet hair and dander. 【Large Capacity Detachable Battery】This vacuum stick cordless detachable with large capacity battery 8-cell lithium-Ion batteries supporting vacuum cleaner with a longer runtime, up to 50 mins on standard mode, 20 mins on max mode. Unique battery-saving technology ensures that the suction of the lightweight vacuum cleaner is always in a state of high power and low power loss. If you have a large area of hardwood floors to vacuum, this cordless cleaner with good battery life is extremely convenient. 【Featherweight Versatile Maneuverability Stick Vacuum 】 The cordless vacuum cleaner weighs about 3.75 lb, only 2/3 of the weight of major vacuums on the market, therefore S8 weight did not tire our hands when we were vacuuming stairs, ceiling corners, and car interior, moreover extremely suitable for one-hand cleaning. Easily converts to a handheld vacuum with versatile attachments to reach corners, stairs crevices, and cars. 【Flexible Design & Easy to Use】Flexible 180°swivels sideways and 90°up and down let you clean the house in all directions. One button to quickly empty the 1L large dustbin, no need to touch the dirt. TASVAC S8 household vacuum cleaner provides you excellent cleaning experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6152NmV8VQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TASVAC","source_asin":"B0BZ7KSSHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ7KSSHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ7KSSHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
