window.products.push({"id":277268,"name":"Quantum Storage Systems WR86-1836C Starter Kit for 86\" High 4-Tier Wire Shelving Unit, Chrome Finish, 18\" Width x 36\" Length x 86\" Height","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":264.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f69uck1xL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Quantum Storage Systems WR86-1836C starter kit includes four wire shelves, four posts, and split sleeves for the assembly of one modular four-tier wire shelving unit. Its open wire design offers visibility of contents, permits air circulation in the work environment, and helps resist dust build-up. The shelves and posts are made of chrome-finished carbon steel for strength, durability, and to resist dirt buildup and corrosion. The wire shelves adjust in 1\" increments to accommodate items of varying heights, and have a welded construction reinforced with wire trusses and struts for strength. The posts are grooved at 1\" intervals to help guide installation of the shelves at desired heights, and come with adjustable levelers to facilitate use on uneven surfaces. Split sleeves on the posts hold and support the shelves. This starter kit has been manufactured to meet National Sanitation Foundation/American National Standards Institute (NSF/ANSI) Standard 2 for use in food handling and processing, dry storage only. The assembled shelving unit measures 86\" x 36\" x 18\" inches (H x W x D). (H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back.) It has an 600 lb. per shelf capacity when the weight is evenly distributed across the shelf. Assembly instructions are included, and no tools are required. Quantum Storage Systems manufactures storage bins and systems, and steel and wire shelving. The company is headquartered in Miami, FL. What's in the Box? (4) Wire shelf, chrome finish, 1\" x 36\" x 18\" (H x W x D) (4) Wire shelf, chrome finish, 1\" x 36\" x 18\" (H x W x D) (4) Post, chrome finish, 86\" (H) (4) Post, chrome finish, 86\" (H) (16) Split sleeve (16) Split sleeve","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f69uck1xL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quantum Storage Systems","source_asin":"B01M1SM0MN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1SM0MN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1SM0MN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
