window.products.push({"id":277292,"name":"The Golden Girls 20-Ounce Stemless Wine Glasses, Set of 2 | Drinking Cup Cocktail Glasses For Home Barware Set, Kitchen Decor | '80s TV Show Comedy Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HLNYWbuaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DRINK TO YOUR FAVORITE GAL PALS Is there such a thing as too much sass? Get the girls together for cheesecake and drinks with this stemless wine glass set. When you can't always say what you want, let The Golden Girls do the talking for you. Each glass cup features a retro character design with a memorable quote from the classic '80s sitcom. Depending on the day, choose whichever wine glass fits your mood, including Blanche Devereaux's \"Quiet You Trash\" or Sophia Petrillo's \"Have I Given You Any Indication At All That I Care?\" Really, there's no wrong choice. Enjoy some laughs while sipping from this collectible glassware inspired by The Golden Girls. CARE INSTRUCTIONS Hand-wash only Not dishwasher safe Not microwave safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HLNYWbuaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silver Buffalo","source_asin":"B09JC297LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JC297LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JC297LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":277293,"name":"Green Bulldog Reusable Grocery Bags - Heavy Duty, Foldable, Space Saving Tote Shopping Bags - Box Bag w/Straps And Handles (Set of 3) - Taupe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91q7-b+zj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-woven REUSABLE - Our space-saving reusable shopping bags can support up to 65 lb each, and replaces up to 6 single-use plastic bags or 4 paper bags. STURDY – These stand-up totes will not spillover. The sides stay upright in your cart, the checkout line or trunk of your car. SPACE SAVING - When you are done, the bags simply fold flat to the size of a notebook for easy placement in your seat back pocket, trunk or kitchen drawer. STORAGE AND ORGANIZATION – Use as storage baskets in your home or car for tools, office supplies or linens. EASY TO USE - No more having to tell the bagger to pull the reinforced bottom flap down. Once opened, there is a clear instructional image with the words “Pull Flap Down” prominently displayed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91q7-b+zj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Bulldog Bags","source_asin":"B08B814NVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B814NVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B814NVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":277294,"name":"Viking Professional Series Santoku Knife 7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ryfNA8sHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Professional Series 7\" Santoku Knife with Hollow Ground from Viking is a superior tool. Viking specialty knives are designed for a specific task and this Santoku knife is certainly no exception. This knife is made to the same standards as other Viking cutlery but with a design made specially to chop, dice and mince with ease, as it is known for it's sharp edges that enhance its cutting performance. The hollow ground design not only adds style, but helps to release thin slices and sticky food after slicing. If you have small hands, or find a cleaver a little overwhelming, a Santoku knife is a good alternative, providing comfortable control and excellent cutting performance. Handcrafted in Solingen, Germany, every Viking Professional knife is forged and ground from a single piece of high-carbon, stainless steel alloy. The results: the finest cutting edge perfectly balanced and easily sharpened with a triple-riveted, long-lasting handle. Lifetime manufacturer's warranty. Product Features Viking 7\" hollow ground blade Hollow-ground dimples create air pockets and reduce drag when cutting delicate fish/meat Handcrafted in Germany of high-carbon stainless steel Ice-hardened stainless steel to increase durability and retain sharpness Full length tang for balance and durability Manufacturer's Limited Lifetime Warranty against manufacturing defects Hand wash recommended","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ryfNA8sHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B0000Y74JQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000Y74JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000Y74JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
