window.products.push({"id":277317,"name":"Cake Drum – 10 inch Cake Drum with Smooth Edges –Square Gold Sturdy Cake Board for Single Cakes and Muti-Tiered Heavy Cakes –1 Pack– by Dreikanter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613UEqUmlUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍰STURDY CAKE DRUM – your beautiful cake creations need a board to sit on without the fear of slipping off or not withstanding the weight of the cake.Our cake boards are perfect for a range of cakes from single tier to multi-tier cakes since they are made from 0.12-inch thick double corrugated cardboard, and they can be used on top of an existing decorative cake stand or as the only base for your cake and will even withstand the weight of a heavy fruit cake. 🍰FULLY GREASEPROOF DESIGN – made from cardboard and Grease Resistant foil, our square cake board range provides exactly what you would expect from a elegant cake drum. The cake board with this oil release film can be cleaned and reused many times after each use. 🍰SUITABLE FOR A VARIETY OF USAGE SCENARIOS – measuring 8 inch x 8 inch and 0.5 inch thick, our square cake drums are perfect for wedding cakes, birthday cakes, christening and baptism cakes, anniversary cakes and much more. Featuring a smooth edge and a grease proof top they are the ideal surface to sit your cake creations.The principle of choosing a cake board: Generally, you need to choose a cake board that is 9 inch larger than the cake. 🍰DIFFERENT COLOR OPTIONS – our range of square cake boards has 11 color choices. Opt between white, silver, gold, or black to perfectly complement your cake. Cake boards of different colors meet the display needs of presenting different styles of cakes you make, and use more suitable color cake boards to express the different characteristics of your exquisite cakes. 🍰MULTIPACK OPTIONS – all color options can be ordered individually or as a multipack. We have single boards for cakes, or you can order a 3 pack, or 13 pack. If you’re a professional baker or just love to bake cakes as a hobby, then our multipacks are exactly what you need to ensure you have a good supply in your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613UEqUmlUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREIKANTER","source_asin":"B0BB7GFBD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7GFBD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7GFBD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
