window.products.push({"id":277513,"name":"TEXAS LINEN CO. Hotel Collection Bed Pillows for Sleeping - Standard Size, Set of 2 - Extra Soft, Cooling, Luxury Cotton Gusseted Pillow for Back, Sto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hqpY6K2UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PILLOW WITH THE RIGHT BALANCE OF SOFTNESS & SUPPORT: Call it a day and hit the hay with our soft & fluffy pillows. Filled with 3D snow down-alternative fibers, it has the same softness and plushness as down pillows—without the allergies. The 100% cotton top is cooling and breathable, and the gusseted construction adds extra support, distributes fill evenly, and maintains the structure of the pillows for a long time. SUITABLE FOR ALL SLEEPING POSITIONS – SIDE, BACK, OR STOMACH: Neither too soft nor firm, Texas Linen’s HOOT Pillows Standard Size Set of 2 are designed for all sleeping positions to keep your head and neck well-rested. The down-alternative filling contours to your body’s natural curve and provides the right cushion and support, so there’s no pressure on the back, shoulders, and spine. HYPOALLERGENIC, SKIN-FRIENDLY, & TODDLER-SAFE: If you don’t like memory foam because they overheat, give our down-alternative standard pillows a try. Made from 100% cotton outer layer, our standard pillows set of 2 keep your skin cool & breathable, wick moisture, and maintain the body’s optimal temperature. Best for hot sleepers. They’re STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certified, which means free from harmful chemicals and safe for kids and sensitive skin. REGULAR MACHINE WASH & CARE: These pillow standard size are machine washable. Use warm water and mild detergent and wash them on a normal cycle. Don’t bleach, iron, or dry clean. Tumble dry on low heat. To fluff up our standard pillow, leave them in sunlight for 48-72 hours, or toss them in a dryer with tennis balls. You can also push them in and out for a few minutes so they start to rise up. LOOKING FOR A GREAT GIFT? WE’VE GOT YOU COVERED: Our original pillows come in two sizes: Standard Size Pillow (19 Inch x 24 Inch - Pack of 1 & 2), King (20 Inch x 34 Inch - Pack of 1 & 2), and Queen Size (20 Inch x 28 Inch - Pack of 1 & 2). If you’re looking for a gift for a housewarming or festive occasion, these luxury hotel pillows are the best. What if you don’t like our pillow standard size set of 2? Get them exchanged/refunded within 30 days on Amazon. Simple!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hqpY6K2UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEXAS LINEN CO.","source_asin":"B0BM5RPC4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM5RPC4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM5RPC4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
