window.products.push({"id":277572,"name":"Kitchen Paper Towel Holder Countertop: Paper Towel Stand Stainless Steel - Rust Proof Paper Towel Holders Easy to Tear with Weighted Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D1YnwjxgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🍳【Practical Countertop Accessory】The paper towel holder is simple and stylish, with a modern design concept. It’s very beautiful in any style of kitchen. The compact design only takes up less kitchen space, and the sturdy stainless steel material is more fashionable and durable. The paper can be easily torn and rotated. You can enjoy your life in the kitchen more happily with it. 🍳[Weighted Base]: This paper towel holder countertop uses the weighted base,weighs 2.87 pounds, and has strong stability. The bottom non-slip silicone soft ring adds a layer of stability protection to the base.The round base will not tilt. When you tear off the paper towel, there will be no shaking, and you can easily tear off the paper towel. 🍳[Flexible Spring Arm]: The paper towel holders have a unique spring arm design, which can slide flexibly, and always provides proper pressure for rolls of different sizes. Even if the paper towel is used to the last one, it can be tightly protected. When need to change the paper towel, only take the empty paper roll off the center rod and drag the spring arm to put the new towel on. 🍳【304 Stainless Steel】Unlike other wood or low-quality stainless steel, kitchen paper towel stand is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel, which will not deform and rust with the long service life. When you want to clean, just wipe it with a damp cloth and wipe it dry to clean it which is simple and convenient. 🍳【Easy to Carry】The carring knob on the top makes the paper towel holder easy to pick up and move. You can transport the holder to any countertop, table or room by grabbing the knob on the top. Paper towel stand is suitable for kitchen, office and various occasions, simple and beautiful.It can be used directly after opening the package without any assembly process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D1YnwjxgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roleader","source_asin":"B09G6FQ5QH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6FQ5QH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6FQ5QH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
