window.products.push({"id":277645,"name":"Oster Titanium-Infused DuraCeramic 2-in-1 Panini Maker and Grill, Black with White Griddles (CKSTPM20W-TECO)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615PBGghZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Press grill marks into cheesy paninis or cook up fajita strips and more with the Oster Titanium-Infused DuraCeramic 2-in-1 Panini Maker and Grill. This bistro-quality sandwich maker grills 30 percent faster than ordinary nonstick cookware, saving both time and energy. Combining two flat griddle surfaces into a single, compact design, it can be used for a wide variety of cooking applications. Use it as a traditional panini press to make great grilled sandwiches or open it flat to use it as a countertop grill. This panini maker features a PFOA- and PTFE-free ceramic coating that is scratch-resistant, withstands flaking and peeling, and easily wipes clean. And thanks to its floating hinge system, it can accommodate sandwiches of a variety of thicknesses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615PBGghZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oster","source_asin":"B00IRFKRYE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IRFKRYE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IRFKRYE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":277646,"name":"Lush Decor Navy Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 7-Piece Comforter Set Reversible Bedding (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xlcmsWK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our Paris-inspired navy bedding set. The modern bedding includes a reversible comforter, 2 matching pillow shams, 2 pillowcases, and 2 unique decorative pillows. The navy side features an elegant pattern of roses, butterflies, and Eiffel Towers with \"Paris\" in script font. The white side features smaller Eiffel Towers with \"Paris\" in script font. The beautiful vintage look with modern metallic printing detail will brighten up any bedroom and pairs well with other floral, vintage, or Eiffel Tower decorThe king comforter measures 92\" L x 108\" W, and the pillow shams and pillowcases measure 20\" L x 36\" W with a 2-inch flange. One decorative pillow measures 12\" L x 18\" W and features the word \"dream\" in blush-pink cursive script. The other decorative pillow measures 16\" and is round, white, and fluffy, adding texture and visual interest. This set is made for a king-size bed, but we also offer this design in twin XL and full/queen sizes.All of our pieces are made of 100% polyester, which is extremely durable and breathable. This material helps wick away moisture as you sleep. We recommend washing your bedding set in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle with similar colors. Tumble dry on low to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious bedding pieces. Iron on low heat as needed, and use only non-chlorine bleach.The navy, pink, and white colors on our cozy reversible comforter sets coordinate with other colors in your home without being overwhelming. The floral comforter design can accent any interior decor style, from bohemian to farmhouse. At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xlcmsWK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B0843V36T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0843V36T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0843V36T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
