window.products.push({"id":277655,"name":"Dosevita Portable Oven Car Food Warmer 12V,24V,110V Mini Personal Microwave Heated Lunch Box for Reheating and Cooking Meals for Car/Truck/Work/Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BSlG4W6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Personal Mini Oven】No more stand in line and microwaving in shared office microwave. With this portable oven, you can have enough time to eat your meal during short lunch break and increase the quality of your work life greatly. Just plug the personal portable oven in before lunch time then the food inside will get steaming hot like fresh. Perfect way to have a lunch for office/outside workers, truck driver, construction, delivery person, business traveler and more. 【3 In 1 Multi-use & Perfectly Heating】This multi-use mini portable microwave comes with 12V/24V for car and truck use, 110V for home and office use. The 70W portable oven lunch box adopts automatic constant temperature heating conduction technology to evenly reheat food and leftovers and even cook food without overcooking. Food is always steaming hot to maintain the freshness of food. 【Easy Using And Cleaning】No monitoring need. It is safe to use without button you can just place your meal inside and plug it in. Then you can enjoy warm and fresh food everyday. It is easy to be removed for cleaning. Wipe off any food with a rag comes right off. 【Fit with Most Containers】This highly versatile portable food warmer is suitable for all types of tubs including glass, plastic, metal, tupperware, aluminum foil, stainless steel, and even cardboard. Accommodates the flat and heat-resistant containers up to 9.84\" L x 7.08\" W x 4.13\" H of food. 【Light Weight & Portable】The Mini food warmer lunch box is light weight and convenient to store. Coming with a insulation bag which is good quality and sturdy. Portable to carry anywhere. The zipper open and close easily. With this mini oven and it will change you life and made work days so much easier! 【Customers Satisfaction Guaranteed】Customer satisfaction is our aim. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us and we will provide you with effective solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BSlG4W6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dosevita","source_asin":"B0BNN3GVZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNN3GVZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNN3GVZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
