window.products.push({"id":277749,"name":"Circleware Acrylic Beverage Dispenser Pitcher with Fruit Infuser, Tube Insert, Lid & Handle Huge 94.6 Ounce-2.8 Liters Carafe for Water Beer Wine Liqu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wryZiUVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy flavor-infused beverages made naturally at home with the Circleware Fruit Infusion PitcherBPA-free acrylic pitcher has removable hollow rod that can be filled with fruits, citrus wedges, herbs, or savoriesNATURAL FRESH FRUITS FLAVOR - Infuse lemon, cucumber, orange, mint, basil and more by adding fruit or herbs it to the filter insert and transform your plain water into a glass or jug of low sugar liquid for kids — a smart soda or juice alternativeFOR ICED TEA AND MORE - Try the lightweight modern dispenser container with tea bags to transform water into iced teas. Also great for making sangria or infused vodka pitchers, and new green blue and red color options are perfect for an outdoor partyCHILL IN FRIDGE AND ENJOY - For optimum flavor, fill core with small cut fruits, herbs or tea bags, add water and let infusers sit in kitchen refrigerator bottom for 3 to 4 hours. Pour and refill into a cup and add ice if you like drinks extra coldEnjoy refreshing lemon water, raspberry iced tea and more and keep it cold with this attractive new combo pitcher. The removable fruit infusion rod can easily be filled with cut lemons, limes, raspberries, etc. and easily slides into the pitcher. Open slots in the rod allow liquids and fruit to mix naturally to give your beverages a fruit-infused flavor. The pitcher can be continually refilled without having to replace the fruit. Attach the removable freezer ice tube (screws into lid) to keep pre-chilled beverages chilled for hours without ice cube dilution. Just fill the ice tube with water one time and keep in the freezer. It may be re-frozen repeatedly without re-filling with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wryZiUVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circleware","source_asin":"B07CMHGLFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-277749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMHGLFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMHGLFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
